<title>JAPAN: Fuji Kosan -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji Kosan -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 43.90		vs	   36.47</p>
<p> Operating	  121    million	  vs	   81    million</p>
<p> Current	    130    million	  vs	   80    million</p>
<p> Net		    7    million	  vs	   45    million</p>
<p> EPS		    0.08 yen	  vs	    0.52 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     87 million	  vs	  87 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuji Kosan Co Ltd is a domestic capital oil producer dealing mainly in lubricants and asphalt.</p>
